      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/pike_creek_delaware"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The creek once carried the name Brewer’s Run, honoring early landowner Brewer Sineckson who owned property along its banks.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://delaware.wiki/a/Pike_Creek"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 2007, CNN Money crowned Pike Creek the top spot on its list of the 100 Best Places to Live in the United States.",
