      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pike_Creek%2C_Delaware"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Pike Creek sits at 39°43′51″N 75°42′15″W, placing it just north of Newark’s university campus.",
